# Root .gitignore for the capstone workspace.
# Each project keeps its own .gitignore as well (Source_Aware_Misinformation_Detector/.gitignore,
# first_hand_authority_model/.gitignore); Git applies those inside their folders.
# Rules here are deliberately targeted: no blanket *.csv / *.json / *.gz / *.zip rules, because Project A
# tracks result tables, frozen rankings and a few small archives.

# --- Secrets, credentials, local environment ---
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.netrc
credentials*.json
*secret*.json
*token*.json

# --- Python caches and virtual environments ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

# --- OS / editor / temporary files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.swp
~$*
.vscode/
.idea/
*claude-notify-signals*

# --- Private annotation keys and sealed / hidden evaluation labels ---
**/_KEY_DO_NOT_GIVE_TO_ANNOTATORS/
*reserved180_gold*
**/ks_reserved180/

# --- Model weights, pickles and caches ---
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
**/feature_cache/
**/hf_cache/

# --- Raw datasets and large downloads ---
Source_Aware_Misinformation_Detector/data/raw/
Source_Aware_Misinformation_Detector/results/rankings_*.jsonl.gz
storage/datasets/*
!storage/datasets/README_RECOVERY_NOTE.md

# --- Backups and archives (local-only) ---
storage/backups/
*.bundle
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# --- Recovery staging: private or redundant material stays local ---
# Claude session transcripts, scratchpads, recycle-bin metadata (private conversation data)
RECOVERY_STAGING_2026-11-13/_preserved_sources/
# byte-identical duplicates of the live Project A / Project B files (Project B copy has its own .git)
RECOVERY_STAGING_2026-11-13/reconstructed/project_A/
RECOVERY_STAGING_2026-11-13/reconstructed/project_A_final/
RECOVERY_STAGING_2026-11-13/reconstructed/project_B/

# --- Personal data ---
# Updated review deck contains team SRNs; keep all review decks out of Git
Source_Aware_Misinformation_Detector/docs/monday_review_2026-11-16/*.pptx
*.pptx
# duplicate full-page screenshot (local only)
Source_Aware_Misinformation_Detector/results/esa_nov2026/demo/screenshots/02_claim268_full.png
